{
  "format": 0,
  "id": "alhambra-mexuar-stars",
  "title": "Mexuar stars",
  "fold": 4,
  "star": 8,
  "style": "Nasrid",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "This uses Manuel Martínez Vela’s published grid method and drawing 3 on the eight-pointed-star grid in ALZADA 115, page 45. We read the outlines and supplied the compass construction and step grouping.",
    "changes": "The article explains the shared grid and shows the completed tracing. It does not give this pattern’s numbered app sequence. Its separate nine-step Partal example is a different pattern. Source credits identify the design and method, not a verbatim sequence.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-21"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "La Alhambra con regla y compás: el trazado de los diseños geométricos nazaríes (ALZADA 115, 2017)",
      "creator": "Manuel Martínez Vela",
      "url": "https://www.riarte.es/handle/20.500.12251/633",
      "note": "The grid of eight-pointed stars and the tracing of this panel (the article's drawing 3) follow this article.",
      "steps": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
    }
  ],
  "given": {
    "O": "The centre of one eight-pointed star.",
    "A": "Any point to the right of O. The distance OA is one square of the grid."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Rule a horizontal line through the centre and draw a small circle. Its radius is one square of the grid, and the compass keeps this opening while you build the grid.",
      "create": {"h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}, "c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}},
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Rule the vertical through the centre. Walk the compass along both lines, both ways, marking a point every square.",
      "create": {
        "Xm1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "h"], "pick": {"angle": 180}}},
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Y1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 90}}},
        "Ym1": {"point": {"meet": ["c", "v"], "pick": {"angle": 270}}},
        "cx1": {"circle": {"centre": "A", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "X2": {"point": {"meet": ["cx1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cy1": {"circle": {"centre": "Y1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Y2": {"point": {"meet": ["cy1", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cxm1": {"circle": {"centre": "Xm1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Xm2": {"point": {"meet": ["cxm1", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "cym1": {"circle": {"centre": "Ym1", "radiusOf": "c"}},
        "Ym2": {"point": {"meet": ["cym1", "v"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}}
      },
      "highlight": ["c", "h"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Through every mark rule a line at right angles to its axis. The lines make a square grid.",
      "create": {
        "Vm2": {"line": {"through": "Xm2", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Hm2": {"line": {"through": "Ym2", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "Vm1": {"line": {"through": "Xm1", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "Hm1": {"line": {"through": "Ym1", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "V1": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "H1": {"line": {"through": "Y1", "perpendicularTo": "v"}},
        "V2": {"line": {"through": "X2", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "H2": {"line": {"through": "Y2", "perpendicularTo": "v"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["h", "v"],
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Open the compass from the centre to the corner of a square diagonally next to it, and draw that circle: it passes through four grid corners. Where it crosses the horizontal, rule lines at 45° both ways. They form a square standing on its corner, which with the grid square around the centre makes an eight-pointed star.",
      "create": {
        "g11": {"point": {"meet": ["V1", "H1"]}},
        "s": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "g11"}},
        "d1": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["A", "O", "Y1"]}},
        "d2": {"line": {"through": "O", "bisects": ["Y1", "O", "Xm1"]}},
        "sm2": {"circle": {"centre": "Xm2", "radiusOf": "s"}},
        "Tm2n": {"point": {"meet": ["sm2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "Tm2p": {"point": {"meet": ["sm2", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "s2": {"circle": {"centre": "X2", "radiusOf": "s"}},
        "T2n": {"point": {"meet": ["s2", "h"], "pick": {"nearest": "O"}}},
        "T2p": {"point": {"meet": ["s2", "h"], "pick": {"farthest": "O"}}},
        "Pm2n": {"line": {"through": "Tm2n", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Mm2n": {"line": {"through": "Tm2n", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "Pm2p": {"line": {"through": "Tm2p", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "Mm2p": {"line": {"through": "Tm2p", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "P2n": {"line": {"through": "T2n", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "M2n": {"line": {"through": "T2n", "parallelTo": "d1"}},
        "P2p": {"line": {"through": "T2p", "parallelTo": "d2"}},
        "M2p": {"line": {"through": "T2p", "parallelTo": "d1"}}
      },
      "highlight": ["g11"],
      "animate": "compass"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mark the crossings where the design turns, and the tile: the square whose corners are two squares from the centre both across and up, so its sides run along the grid.",
      "create": {
        "Q1": {"point": {"meet": ["V2", "H2"]}},
        "Q2": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "H2"]}},
        "Q3": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "Hm2"]}},
        "Q4": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm2", "V2"]}},
        "Q5": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm2", "Pm2n"]}},
        "Q6": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm2", "Pm2p"]}},
        "Q7": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "Hm1"]}},
        "Q8": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm1", "M2n"]}},
        "Q9": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm1", "V1"]}},
        "Q10": {"point": {"meet": ["Hm1", "P2n"]}},
        "Q11": {"point": {"meet": ["h", "Pm2p"]}},
        "Q12": {"point": {"meet": ["h", "P2n"]}},
        "Q13": {"point": {"meet": ["H1", "Pm2p"]}},
        "Q14": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "H1"]}},
        "Q15": {"point": {"meet": ["H1", "Mm2p"]}},
        "Q16": {"point": {"meet": ["V1", "H1"]}},
        "Q17": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "Mm2n"]}},
        "Q18": {"point": {"meet": ["H2", "Mm2n"]}},
        "Q19": {"point": {"meet": ["V1", "Mm2p"]}},
        "Q20": {"point": {"meet": ["H2", "Mm2p"]}},
        "Q21": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "M2n"]}},
        "Q22": {"point": {"meet": ["V2", "P2n"]}},
        "Q23": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm2", "Pm2n"]}},
        "Q24": {"point": {"meet": ["Vm1", "Pm2p"]}},
        "Q25": {"point": {"meet": ["v", "Pm2p"]}},
        "Q26": {"point": {"meet": ["v", "Mm2p"]}},
        "Q27": {"point": {"meet": ["V1", "P2n"]}},
        "Q28": {"point": {"meet": ["V2", "M2n"]}},
        "tile": {"polygon": ["Q1", "Q2", "Q3", "Q4"]}
      },
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
